{"id":"n15436-3-3","stage":3,"title":"바가지 · 宰客","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15436-3-3-1","ko":"이번 연휴에 바닷가에 놀러 갔더니 뭘 해도 바가지였잖아.","zh":"这次连休去海边玩，干什么都被宰。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연휴에","meaning":"连休","explanation":"연휴：连休；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"연휴","audio":"/audio/381948faf6ba74167998.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67804","senseId":"1","lemma":"연휴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바닷가에","meaning":"海边，海滨","explanation":"바닷가：海边，海滨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닷가","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56428","senseId":"1","lemma":"바닷가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"游荡，晃悠","explanation":"놀다：游荡，晃悠；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"7","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔더니","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바가지였잖아.","meaning":"宰客，宰客价","explanation":"바가지：宰客，宰客价；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"바가지","audio":"/audio/7dc5af7bbc86ad48ec5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15436","senseId":"3","lemma":"바가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"381948faf6ba7416","term":"연휴","zh":"连休","audio":"/audio/381948faf6ba74167998.mp3","entryId":"67804","definition":"休息两天以上；或指那样的假日。","pronunciation":["연휴"]},{"id":"edee03fff87eddb6","term":"바닷가","zh":"海边，海滨","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3","entryId":"56428","definition":"大海和陆地相连的地方或其附近。","pronunciation":["바다까","바닫까"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"游荡，晃悠","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"到处转悠。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"7dc5af7bbc86ad48","term":"바가지","zh":"宰客，宰客价","audio":"/audio/7dc5af7bbc86ad48ec5d.mp3","entryId":"15436","definition":"明显高出合理价格的费用或购物费用。","pronunciation":["바가지"]}],"audio":"/audio/0fa2a76cd1680a21766a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15436-3-3-2","ko":"나도 숙박비를 평소보다 훨씬 비싸게 줬어.","zh":"我付的住宿费也比平时贵多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숙박비를","meaning":"住宿费","explanation":"숙박비：住宿费；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙박비","audio":"/audio/b844d31fad2e109ede08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64993","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙박비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평소보다","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훨씬","meaning":"更加，远远地","explanation":"훨씬：更加，远远地","readings":[{"term":"훨씬","audio":"/audio/b364daea4cbc5e721b5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73250","senseId":"1","lemma":"훨씬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싸게","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬어.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b844d31fad2e109e","term":"숙박비","zh":"住宿费","audio":"/audio/b844d31fad2e109ede08.mp3","entryId":"64993","definition":"在旅馆或酒店等睡觉停留花的费用。","pronunciation":["숙빡삐"]},{"id":"ebf09ee6c46b848f","term":"평소","zh":"平常，平时，平日","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3","entryId":"71341","definition":"没有特别事情，通常的时候。","pronunciation":["평소"]},{"id":"b364daea4cbc5e72","term":"훨씬","zh":"更加，远远地","audio":"/audio/b364daea4cbc5e721b5e.mp3","entryId":"73250","definition":"与某物相比差别很大地。","pronunciation":["훨씬"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/43dc1b176e5c6ba69b09.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15436","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次连休去海边玩，干什么都被宰。","我付的住宿费也比平时贵多了。","最近大家都很喜欢读的著作有哪些呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次连休去海边玩，干什么都被宰。","我付的住宿费也比平时贵多了。","最近大家都很喜欢读的著作有哪些呢？"],"answer":1}]}
